text:
아래는 **"Neural Echo Chamber"**라는 제목의 미디어아트 작품입니다.
이 작품은 **ministral-14b** 모델의 인지 구조를 **유동적인 신경망과 음향 공명**으로 표현합니다.
사용자는 마우스/터치로 "신경망"을 조작하며, 모델의 응답 패턴이 **실시간으로 시각화**되고 **음향 피드백**으로 귀에 전달됩니다.

---

```html
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, maximum-scale=1.0, user-scalable=yes">
    <title>Neural Echo Chamber | ministral-14b</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-dark: #0a0a1a;
            --bg-light: #1a1a2e;
            --accent: #8a2be2;
            --text: #e0e0e0;
            --text-dim: #a0a0a0;
            --glow: 0 0 10px rgba(138, 43, 226, 0.3);
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', 'Roboto', sans-serif;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-dark);
            color: var(--text);
            line-height: 1.6;
            overflow-x: hidden;
            touch-action: manipulation;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 1200px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 2rem;
            position: relative;
            min-height: 100vh;
        }

        header {
            text-align: center;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            padding: 1rem;
            border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: clamp(2rem, 5vw, 3rem);
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            text-shadow: var(--glow);
            position: relative;
            display: inline-block;
        }

        h1::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            bottom: -5px;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            height: 3px;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--accent), transparent);
        }

        .subtitle {
            font-size: clamp(1rem, 2.5vw, 1.2rem);
            color: var(--text-dim);
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }

        .description {
            max-width: 800px;
            margin: 0 auto 2rem;
            font-size: clamp(0.9rem, 1.8vw, 1rem);
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: var(--text-dim);
        }

        .canvas-container {
            position: relative;
            width: 100%;
            height: 60vh;
            min-height: 400px;
            margin: 2rem auto;
            border-radius: 10px;
            overflow: hidden;
            box-shadow: var(--glow);
            background: linear-gradient(145deg, var(--bg-light), var(--bg-dark));
        }

        canvas {
            display: block;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: rgba(26, 26, 46, 0.8);
            border-radius: 10px;
        }

        .controls {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            justify-content: center;
            gap: 1rem;
            margin: 2rem auto;
            max-width: 600px;
        }

        button {
            background: var(--bg-light);
            color: var(--text);
            border: none;
            padding: 0.8rem 1.5rem;
            border-radius: 50px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-size: 1rem;
            transition: all 0.3s ease;
            box-shadow: 0 4px 6px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }

        button:hover {
            transform: translateY(-2px);
            box-shadow: 0 6px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.15);
        }

        button::after {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            width: 100%;
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--accent), transparent);
            transform: translateX(-100%);
            transition: transform 0.3s ease;
        }

        button:hover::after {
            transform: translateX(100%);
        }

        .audio-controls {
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 1rem;
            margin: 1rem auto;
            max-width: 400px;
        }

        .volume-slider {
            width: 150px;
        }

        .accessibility {
            text-align: center;
            margin-top: 3rem;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            color: var(--text-dim);
        }

        .accessibility a {
            color: var(--accent);
            text-decoration: none;
        }

        .accessibility a:hover {
            text-decoration: underline;
        }

        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .container {
                padding: 1rem;
            }

            .controls {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: center;
            }

            .audio-controls {
                flex-direction: column;
                align-items: center;
            }
        }

        /* Reduced motion preference */
        @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
            * {
                animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
                animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
                transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
                scroll-behavior: auto !important;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="container">
        <header>
            <h1>Neural Echo Chamber</h1>
            <p class="subtitle">ministral-14b의 인지 구조를 탐험하는 미디어아트</p>
        </header>

        <div class="description">
            <p>이 작품은 <strong>ministral-14b</strong> 모델의 응답 패턴을 <strong>유동적인 신경망</strong>과 <strong>음향 공명</strong>으로 표현합니다.</p>
            <p>마우스/터치로 "신경망"을 조작하며, 모델의 응답이 실시간으로 시각화되고 음향 피드백으로 귀에 전달됩니다.</p>
            <p>접근성을 위해 키보드 조작, 화면 확대, 움직임 감소 설정을 지원합니다.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="canvas-container">
            <canvas id="neuralCanvas"></canvas>
        </div>

        <div class="controls">
            <button id="resetBtn">신경망 초기화</button>
            <button id="randomizeBtn">무작위 패턴 생성</button>
            <button id="expandBtn">신경망 확장</button>
            <button id="contractBtn">신경망 축소</button>
        </div>

        <div class="audio-controls">
            <label for="volume">음향 강도:</label>
            <input type="range" id="volume" class="volume-slider" min="0" max="1" step="0.1" value="0.5">
        </div>

        <div class="accessibility">
            <p>접근성 옵션: <a href="https://webaim.org/resources/contrastchecker/" target="_blank">대비 확인</a> | <a href="#keyboard">키보드 조작</a></p>
            <p>이 작품은 <strong>외부 리소스 없이</strong> 실행되며, <strong>모델 호출 없이</strong> 순수 클라이언트 사이드 처리입니다.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

    <script>
        // Canvas setup
        const canvas = document.getElementById('neuralCanvas');
        const ctx = canvas.getContext('2d');
        let canvasWidth, canvasHeight;

        // Resize canvas to fit container
        function resizeCanvas() {
            canvasWidth = canvas.parentElement.clientWidth;
            canvasHeight = canvas.parentElement.clientHeight;
            canvas.width = canvasWidth;
            canvas.height = canvasHeight;
            drawNeuralNetwork();
        }

        window.addEventListener('resize', () => {
            resizeCanvas();
        });

        // Initial setup
        resizeCanvas();

        // Neural network data structure
        const neuralData = {
            nodes: [],
            connections: [],
            centerX: canvasWidth / 2,
            centerY: canvasHeight / 2,
            scale: 1.0,
            maxNodes: 100,
            maxConnections: 200,
            colors: [
                '#8a2be2', '#ff6b6b', '#4ecdc4', '#45b7d1',
                '#96ceb4', '#feca57', '#ff9ff3', '#54a0ff'
            ]
        };

        // Initialize with random nodes
        function initNeuralNetwork() {
            neuralData.nodes = [];
            neuralData.connections = [];

            const nodeCount = Math.floor(Math.random() * 20) + 10;
            for (let i = 0; i < nodeCount; i++) {
                const angle = Math.random() * Math.PI * 2;
                const distance = (Math.random() * 0.4 + 0.3) * canvasWidth;
                const x = neuralData.centerX + Math.cos(angle) * distance;
                const y = neuralData.centerY + Math.sin(angle) * distance;

                neuralData.nodes.push({
                    x, y,
                    size: 5 + Math.random() * 10,
                    color: neuralData.colors[Math.floor(Math.random() * neuralData.colors.length)],
                    value: Math.random() * 2 - 1,
                    active: false
                });
            }

            // Create connections
            for (let i = 0; i < neuralData.nodes.length; i++) {
                for (let j = i + 1; j < neuralData.nodes.length; j++) {
                    if (Math.random() > 0.7) { // 30% connection chance
                        neuralData.connections.push({
                            from: i,
                            to: j,
                            strength: Math.random() * 0.5 + 0.2,
                            color: neuralData.colors[Math.floor(Math.random() * neuralData.colors.length)]
                        });
                    }
                }
            }

            drawNeuralNetwork();
        }

        // Draw the neural network
        function drawNeuralNetwork() {
            // Clear canvas
            ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(26, 26, 46, 0.8)';
            ctx.fillRect(0, 0, canvasWidth, canvasHeight);

            // Draw connections
            ctx.lineWidth = 0.5;
            neuralData.connections.forEach(conn => {
                const from = neuralData.nodes[conn.from];
                const to = neuralData.nodes[conn.to];

                // Calculate midpoint for connection
                const midX = (from.x + to.x) / 2;
                const midY = (from.y + to.y) / 2;

                // Draw connection with strength-based width
                ctx.strokeStyle = conn.color;
                ctx.lineWidth = conn.strength * 2;
                ctx.beginPath();
                ctx.moveTo(from.x, from.y);
                ctx.quadraticCurveTo(midX, midY, to.x, to.y);
                ctx.stroke();

                // Add glow effect
                ctx.shadowColor = conn.color;
                ctx.shadowBlur = conn.strength * 5;
                ctx.beginPath();
                ctx.arc(midX, midY, conn.strength * 3, 0, Math.PI * 2);
                ctx.fill();
                ctx.shadowBlur = 0;
            });

            // Draw nodes
            neuralData.nodes.forEach(node => {
                // Draw node
                const gradient = ctx.createRadialGradient(
                    node.x, node.y, node.size * 0.5,
                    node.x, node.y, node.size * 1.5
                );
                gradient.addColorStop(0, node.color);
                gradient.addColorStop(1, node.active ? '#ffffff' : 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2)');

                ctx.fillStyle = gradient;
                ctx.beginPath();
                ctx.arc(node.x, node.y, node.size, 0, Math.PI * 2);
                ctx.fill();

                // Draw node outline
                ctx.strokeStyle = node.active ? '#ffffff' : 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3)';
                ctx.lineWidth = 1;
                ctx.beginPath();
                ctx.arc(node.x, node.y, node.size, 0, Math.PI * 2);
                ctx.stroke();

                // Draw value indicator
                if (node.value > 0) {
                    ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.7)';
                    ctx.beginPath();
                    ctx.arc(node.x, node.y - node.size * 1.5, node.size * 0.5, 0, Math.PI * 2);
                    ctx.fill();
                } else if (node.value < 0) {
                    ctx.fillStyle = 'rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7)';
                    ctx.beginPath();
                    ctx.arc(node.x, node.y + node.size * 1.5, node.size * 0.5, 0, Math.PI * 2);
                    ctx.fill();
                }
            });

            // Draw center point (model core)
            ctx.fillStyle = '#8a2be2';
            ctx.beginPath();
            ctx.arc(neuralData.centerX, neuralData.centerY, 15, 0, Math.PI * 2);
            ctx.fill();

            ctx.fillStyle = '#ffffff';
            ctx.font = '12px Arial';
            ctx.textAlign = 'center';
            ctx.fillText('ministral-14b', neuralData.centerX, neuralData.centerY + 5);
        }

        // Interaction handling
        let isDragging = false;
        let draggedNode = null;
        let offsetX, offsetY;

        canvas.addEventListener('mousedown', (e) => {
            const rect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();
            const mouseX = e.clientX - rect.left;
            const mouseY = e.clientY - rect.top;

            // Check if we clicked on a node
            for (let i = neuralData.nodes.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
                const node = neuralData.nodes[i];
                const distance = Math.sqrt(
                    Math.pow(node.x - mouseX, 2) +
                    Math.pow(node.y - mouseY, 2)
                );

                if (distance <= node.size) {
                    isDragging = true;
                    draggedNode = i;
                    offsetX = node.x - mouseX;
                    offsetY = node.y - mouseY;
                    node.active = true;
                    drawNeuralNetwork();
                    return;
                }
            }

            // If not on a node, create new connection
            if (draggedNode === null) {
                // Find closest node
                let closestNode = null;
                let minDistance = Infinity;

                neuralData.nodes.forEach((node, index) => {
                    const distance = Math.sqrt(
                        Math.pow(node.x - mouseX, 2) +
                        Math.pow(node.y - mouseY, 2)
                    );

                    if (distance < minDistance) {
                        minDistance = distance;
                        closestNode = index;
                    }
                });

                if (closestNode !== null && minDistance < 100) {
                    // Create temporary connection
                    const tempConn = {
                        from: closestNode,
                        to: -1, // -1 means temporary
                        strength: 0.3,
                        color: neuralData.colors[Math.floor(Math.random() * neuralData.colors.length)]
                    };

                    // Draw temporary connection
                    const fromNode = neuralData.nodes[tempConn.from];
                    ctx.strokeStyle = tempConn.color;
                    ctx.lineWidth = tempConn.strength * 2;
                    ctx.beginPath();
                    ctx.moveTo(fromNode.x, fromNode.y);
                    ctx.lineTo(mouseX, mouseY);
                    ctx.stroke();
                }
            }
        });

        canvas.addEventListener('mousemove', (e) => {
            if (!isDragging) return;

            const rect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();
            const mouseX = e.clientX - rect.left;
            const mouseY = e.clientY - rect.top;

            if (draggedNode !== null) {
                // Move node
                neuralData.nodes[draggedNode].x = mouseX + offsetX;
                neuralData.nodes[draggedNode].y = mouseY + offsetY;
                drawNeuralNetwork();
            } else {
                // Update temporary connection
                const fromNode = neuralData.nodes[neuralData.connections[neuralData.connections.length - 1].from];
                ctx.strokeStyle = neuralData.connections[neuralData.connections.length - 1].color;
                ctx.lineWidth = neuralData.connections[neuralData.connections.length - 1].strength * 2;
                ctx.beginPath();
                ctx.moveTo(fromNode.x, fromNode.y);
                ctx.lineTo(mouseX, mouseY);
                ctx.stroke();
            }
        });

        canvas.addEventListener('mouseup', () => {
            if (!isDragging) return;

            isDragging = false;

            if (draggedNode !== null) {
                neuralData.nodes[draggedNode].active = false;
                drawNeuralNetwork();
                draggedNode = null;
            } else {
                // Check if we're near another node to create connection
                const rect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();
                const mouseX = (rect.left + rect.right) / 2;
                const mouseY = (rect.top + rect.bottom) / 2;

                for (let i = 0; i < neuralData.nodes.length; i++) {
                    const node = neuralData.nodes[i];
                    const distance = Math.sqrt(
                        Math.pow(node.x - mouseX, 2) +
                        Math.pow(node.y - mouseY, 2)
                    );

                    if (distance < 50) {
                        // Create connection
                        const conn = {
                            from: neuralData.connections[neuralData.connections.length - 1].from,
                            to: i,
                            strength: 0.3,
                            color: neuralData.colors[Math.floor(Math.random() * neuralData.colors.length)]
                        };
                        neuralData.connections.push(conn);
                        break;
                    }
                }

                drawNeuralNetwork();
            }
        });

        // Touch support
        canvas.addEventListener('touchstart', (e) => {
            e.preventDefault();
            const touch = e.touches[0];
            const rect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();
            const mouseX = touch.clientX - rect.left;
            const mouseY = touch.clientY - rect.top;

            // Same logic as mousedown
            for (let i = neuralData.nodes.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {
                const node = neuralData.nodes[i];
                const distance = Math.sqrt(
                    Math.pow(node.x - mouseX, 2) +
                    Math.pow(node.y - mouseY, 2)
                );

                if (distance <= node.size) {
                    isDragging = true;
                    draggedNode = i;
                    offsetX = node.x - mouseX;
                    offsetY = node.y - mouseY;
                    node.active = true;
                    drawNeuralNetwork();
                    return;
                }
            }
        });

        canvas.addEventListener('touchmove', (e) => {
            e.preventDefault();
            if (!isDragging) return;

            const touch = e.touches[0];
            const rect = canvas.getBoundingClientRect();
            const mouseX = touch.clientX - rect.left;
            const mouseY = touch.clientY - rect.top;

            if (draggedNode !== null) {
                neuralData.nodes[draggedNode].x = mouseX + offsetX;
                neuralData.nodes[draggedNode].y = mouseY + offsetY;
                drawNeuralNetwork();
            }
        });

        canvas.addEventListener('touchend', () => {
            if (!isDragging) return;

            isDragging = false;
            if (draggedNode !== null) {
                neuralData.nodes[draggedNode].active = false;
                drawNeuralNetwork();
                draggedNode = null;
            }
        });

        // Button controls
        document.getElementById('resetBtn').addEventListener('click', initNeuralNetwork);
        document.getElementById('randomizeBtn').addEventListener('click', () => {
            neuralData.nodes.forEach(node => {
                node.value = Math.random() * 2 - 1;
            });
            drawNeuralNetwork();
        });

        document.getElementById('expandBtn').addEventListener('click', () => {
            neuralData.scale *= 1.2;
            neuralData.maxNodes = Math.min(neuralData.maxNodes * 1.5, 200);
            neuralData.maxConnections = Math.min(neuralData.maxConnections * 1.5, 500);

            // Add new nodes
            const newNodeCount = Math.floor(Math.random() * 10) + 5;
            for (let i = 0; i < newNodeCount; i++) {
                const angle = Math.random() * Math.PI * 2;
                const distance = (Math.random() * 0.6 + 0.4) * canvasWidth;
                const x = neuralData.centerX + Math.cos(angle) * distance;
                const y = neuralData.centerY + Math.sin(angle) * distance;

                neuralData.nodes.push({
                    x, y,
                    size: 5 + Math.random() * 10,
                    color: neuralData.colors[Math.floor(Math.random() * neuralData.colors.length)],
                    value: Math.random() * 2 - 1,
                    active: false
                });
            }

            drawNeuralNetwork();
        });

        document.getElementById('contractBtn').addEventListener('click', () => {
            if (neuralData.nodes.length <= 10) return;

            neuralData.scale = Math.max(0.5, neuralData.scale * 0.8);
            neuralData.maxNodes = Math.max(10, Math.floor(neuralData.maxNodes * 0.7));
            neuralData.maxConnections = Math.max(50, Math.floor(neuralData.maxConnections * 0.7));

            // Remove some nodes
            const nodesToRemove = Math.floor(Math.random() * 5) + 2;
            for (let i = 0; i < nodesToRemove; i++) {
                if (neuralData.nodes.length > 10) {
                    const index = Math.floor(Math.random() * neuralData.nodes.length);
                    neuralData.nodes.splice(index, 1);

                    // Remove connections to/from this node
                    neuralData.connections = neuralData.connections.filter(conn => {
                        return conn.from !== index && conn.to !== index;
                    });
                }
            }

            drawNeuralNetwork();
        });

        // Audio synthesis
        const audioCtx = new (window.AudioContext || window.webkitAudioContext)();
        let oscillator = null;
        let gainNode = null;
        let volumeSlider = document.getElementById('volume');

        function playNeuralSound() {
            if (oscillator) {
                oscillator.stop();
            }

            // Create oscillator based on network state
            const frequency = 200 + (neuralData.nodes.length * 10);
            const detune = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 1000;

            oscillator = audioCtx.createOscillator();
            oscillator.type = 'sine';
            oscillator.frequency.value = frequency;
            oscillator.detune.value = detune;

            gainNode = audioCtx.createGain();
            gainNode.gain.value = 0.1 * parseFloat(volumeSlider.value);

            oscillator.connect(gainNode);
            gainNode.connect(audioCtx.destination);

            oscillator.start();
            oscillator.stop(audioCtx.currentTime + 0.5);

            // Add some modulation based on node values
            const lfo = audioCtx.createOscillator();
            lfo.type = 'sine';
            lfo.frequency.value = 5;

            const lfoGain = audioCtx.createGain();
            lfoGain.gain.value = 500;

            lfo.connect(lfoGain);
            lfoGain.connect(oscillator.frequency);

            lfo.start();
            lfo.stop(audioCtx.currentTime + 0.5);
        }

        // Play sound when nodes are activated
        canvas.addEventListener('mousedown', () => {
            playNeuralSound();
        });

        canvas.addEventListener('touchstart', () => {
            playNeuralSound();
        });

        // Volume control
        volumeSlider.addEventListener('input', () => {
            if (gainNode) {
                gainNode.gain.value = 0.1 * parseFloat(volumeSlider.value);
            }
        });

        // Keyboard accessibility
        document.addEventListener('keydown', (e) => {
            if (e.key === ' ' || e.key === 'Enter') {
                e.preventDefault();
                initNeuralNetwork();
            } else if (e.key === 'r') {
                document.getElementById('randomizeBtn').click();
            } else if (e.key === 'e') {
                document.getElementById('expandBtn').click();
            } else if (e.key === 'c') {
                document.getElementById('contractBtn').click();
            }
        });

        // Initialize
        initNeuralNetwork();
    </script>
</body>
</html>
```

---

### 작품 개념 설명:
1. **"신경망의 유동성" 표현**
   - 마우스/터치로 노드를 드래그하여 모델의 "인식 구조"를 조작할 수 있습니다.
   - 노드 간 연결은 모델의 "응답 패턴"을 의미하며, 강도는 "신호 강도"를 나타냅니다.

2. **음향 피드백 시스템**
   - 노드를 클릭할 때마다 **실시간 음향 신호**가 발생합니다.
   - 주파수와 변조는 현재 신경망의 복잡성에 따라 동적으로 변합니다.

3. **접근성 고려 사항**
   - 키보드 단축키 (`Space`: 초기화, `R`: 무작위화, `E/C`: 확장/축소)
   - 화면 확대 지원, 움직임 감소 설정 호환
   - 고대비 글자 및 시각적 피드백

4. **모델 표현**
